return {h=5,w=55,cr=170,hc=10,bh=70,gr="fast",eg={"fairy"},st={115,45,20,45,25,20},ab={{56,0},{172,0},{132,1}},genus={en="Balloon Pokémon",es="Pokémon Globo",pt="Pokémon Balão"},flavor={en={[1]="When its huge eyes light up, it sings a mysteriously soothing melody that lulls its enemies to sleep.",[2]="When its huge eyes light up, it sings a mysteriously soothing melody that lulls its enemies to sleep.",[3]="Uses its alluring eyes to enrapture its foe. It then sings a pleasing melody that lulls the foe to sleep.",[4]="If it inflates to SING a lullaby, it can perform longer and cause sure drowsiness in its audience.",[5]="Looking into its cute, round eyes causes it to sing a relaxing melody, inducing its enemies to sleep.",[6]="It rolls its cute eyes as it sings a soothing lullaby. Its gentle song puts anyone who hears it to sleep.",[7]="JIGGLYPUFF’s vocal chords can freely adjust the wavelength of its voice. This Pokémon uses this ability to sing at precisely the right wavelength to make its foes most drowsy.",[8]="When this Pokémon sings, it never pauses to breathe. If it is in a battle against an opponent that does not easily fall asleep, JIGGLYPUFF cannot breathe, endangering its life.",[9]="Nothing can avoid falling asleep hearing a JIGGLYPUFF’s song. The sound waves of its singing voice match the brain waves of someone in a deep sleep.",[10]="It captivates foes with its huge, round eyes, then lulls them to sleep by singing a soothing melody.",[11]="When its huge eyes waver, it sings a mysteriously soothing melody that lulls its enemies to sleep.",[12]="When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.",[13]="When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.",[14]="When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.",[15]="If it inflates to sing a lullaby, it can perform longer and cause sure drowsiness in its audience.",[16]="Looking into its cute, round eyes causes it to sing a relaxing melody, inducing its enemies to sleep.",[17]="When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.",[18]="When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.",[21]="Looking into its cute, round eyes makes it start singing a song so pleasant listeners can’t help but fall asleep.",[22]="Looking into its cute, round eyes makes it start singing a song so pleasant listeners can’t help but fall asleep.",[23]="It captivates foes with its huge, round eyes, then lulls them to sleep by singing a soothing melody.",[24]="If it inflates to sing a lullaby, it can perform longer and cause sure drowsiness in its audience.",[25]="Jigglypuff’s vocal cords can freely adjust the wavelength of its voice. This Pokémon uses this ability to sing at precisely the right wavelength to make its foes most drowsy.",[26]="When this Pokémon sings, it never pauses to breathe. If it is in a battle against an opponent that does not easily fall asleep, Jigglypuff cannot breathe, endangering its life.",[27]="It hugely inflates its stomach and sings a mysterious melody. If you hear this melody, you’ll become sleepy right away.",[28]="Jigglypuff possess a vocal range that exceeds 12 octaves, but each individual’s singing skill depends on its own effort.",[29]="Recordings of Jigglypuff’s strange lullabies can be purchased from department stores. These CDs can be found near the bedding area.",[30]="The songs they sing are totally different depending on the region they live in. Some even sound like they’re shouting!",[31]="Uses its cute round eyes to enrapture its foe. It then sings a pleasing melody that lulls the foe to sleep.",[32]="Uses its cute round eyes to enrapture its foe. It then sings a pleasing melody that lulls the foe to sleep.",[33]="Jigglypuff has top-notch lung capacity, even by comparison to other Pokémon. It won’t stop singing its lullabies until its foes fall asleep.",[34]="By freely changing the wavelength of its voice, Jigglypuff sings a mysterious melody sure to make any listener sleepy."},es={[23]="Cautiva con la mirada a su enemigo y hace que se quede profundamente dormido mientras entona una dulce melodía.",[24]="Si se hincha para cantar una nana, cantará más tiempo y podría causar sopor en el público.",[25]="Jigglypuff tiene unas cuerdas vocales que ajustan sin problema la longitud de onda de su voz. Este Pokémon usa la habilidad que tiene para cantar con la longitud de onda necesaria para adormecer a su rival.",[26]="Cuando este Pokémon canta, no para nunca para respirar. Si en combate el enemigo no se queda dormido con facilidad, Jigglypuff no podrá respirar y su vida correrá peligro.",[27]="Hincha su vientre considerablemente y entona una melodía misteriosa que duerme en el acto a todo aquel que la oye.",[28]="Su tesitura suele ser de 12 octavas, pero su habilidad en el canto dependerá del esfuerzo que realice cada individuo.",[29]="En la sección de muebles de dormitorio de los grandes almacenes se pueden encontrar discos recopilatorios de nanas cantadas por Jigglypuff.",[30]="Su canto varía enormemente de una región a otra. En algunos casos, más que cantos parecen aullidos.",[31]="Tras fijar su tierna mirada en el objetivo, entona una dulce y misteriosa melodía para adormecerlo.",[32]="Tras fijar su tierna mirada en el objetivo, entona una dulce y misteriosa melodía para adormecerlo.",[33]="Su capacidad pulmonar es excepcional, incluso para un Pokémon. Es capaz de cantar nanas sin cesar hasta que su rival se duerma.",[34]="Posee la capacidad de modular su voz a voluntad cambiando la longitud de onda para entonar una melodía misteriosa que provoca adormecimiento."},pt="Mudando livremente o comprimento de onda da voz, Jigglypuff canta uma melodia misteriosa que dá sono em qualquer um que a ouça."},evo={{s=174},{s=39,from=174,c={{t="level-up",happy=160}}},{s=40,from=39,c={{t="use-item",item=81}}}},moves={[1]={1,47,